/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2009 StTriggerData2009

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 9 (year 2009) trigger data.

\section sec2009_overview Overview

StTriggerData2009 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 9 (year 2009)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2009 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2009.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Run 9 introduces a <b>block-based DAQ trigger format</b>: the monolithic \c TrgDataType struct
of Runs 3–8 is replaced by a self-describing multi-block layout where each detector crate
occupies a separate variable-length sub-block.  The class decodes these blocks into transient
arrays during construction and provides uniform pre/post-crossing access.

\section sec2009_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2009
\endcode

\section sec2009_runyear Run Year
Run 9, calendar year 2009 &mdash; p+p collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV and 500 GeV.

\section sec2009_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2009* | Pointer to the raw Run 9 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2009* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2009* | Decoded layer-1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2009* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mBC1[11]…mQT4[11] | various block pointers | Per-crossing detector crate sub-blocks (transient). |

\section sec2009_new New Compared to 2008

<b>Block-based DAQ format</b> (TriggerDataBlk2009 replaces TrgDataType2008).

New accessor methods:
- eventNumber() &mdash; DAQ event number.
- l2sum() &mdash; 64-bit L2 summary.
- readData(const TriggerDataBlk2009*, int bs) &mdash; explicit decode with byte-swap.
- zdcPresent(), zdcPmtTDC(), zdcEarliestTDC(), zdcSumADCaboveThreshold(),
  zdcFrontADCaboveThreshold(), zdcBackADCaboveThreshold(), zdcTruncatedSum() (ZDC DSM L1).
- zdcSumADCaboveThresholdL2(), zdcFrontADCaboveThresholdL2(), zdcBackADCaboveThresholdL2(),
  zdcTimeDifference() (ZDC DSM L2).
- zdcSumADCaboveThresholdL3(), zdcFrontADCaboveThresholdL3(), zdcBackADCaboveThresholdL3(),
  zdcTimeDifferenceInWindow() (ZDC last DSM).
- zdcSMDPresent(), zdcSMDHighestStrip().
- vpdADCHighThr(), vpdTDCHighThr(), vpdEarliestTDCHighThr() (VPD high threshold).
- mtdDsmAtCh(), mtdDsmHit(), mtdgemAtAddress() (MTD DSM).
- tofTrayMultiplicity() (BTOF per-tray).
- bbcEarliestTDCLarge(), bbcTimeDifferenceLarge() (BBC large tile).
- fmsADC(), fmsTDC() (FMS ADC/TDC).
- pp2ppADC(), pp2ppTAC(), pp2ppDSM() (PP2PP roman pots).
- getDsm0_BEMCE(), getDsm0_BEMCW(), getDsm1_BEMC() (first format to return non-null).
- killFMS() (for StFmsHitMaker only).

CTB methods are not available in Run 9 format.

\section sec2009_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    bool zdcCoinc       = trgData->zdcTimeDifferenceInWindow();
    unsigned short vpdH = trgData->vpdEarliestTDCHighThr(east, 0);
    unsigned short tofT = trgData->tofTrayMultiplicity(0, 0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2008
\see StTriggerData2012
*/
